abstract: >-
  Research scripts for the analysis described in Quantifying Behavioral Contributions
  to Diabetes Risk Using an Explainable Multiclass Machine Learning Framework with
  BRFSS 2024. Reorganized code has not been validated through an end-to-end rerun.
